cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Hierarchical Forecasting of Residential Construction Activity (MSTL-LSTM-MinT)"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a three-stage hierarchical forecasting architecture
  combining MSTL seasonal-trend decomposition, LSTM deep residual learning, and
  empirical minimum trace reconciliation, applied to 35 years of New Zealand
  building consent data across three hierarchies (consents, gross floor area,
  capital value) and three building typologies.
type: software
